se,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2014-07-09T02:15:08Z","updated_at":"2025-04-17T18:05:28Z","closed_at":"2014-08-16T11:35:06Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I am using sample SimpleTexturedOpenGL to learn to render with texture. It works well with the default input spider.obj. But when I changed the input to my own model, I got an unhandled exception.\n\nThe exception occured in the excution of [Row 257](https://github.com/assimp/assimp/blob/master/samples/SimpleTexturedOpenGL/SimpleTexturedOpenGL/src/model_loading.cpp#LC257)\n\n```\nglTexImage2D(GL_TEXTURE_2D, 0, ilGetInteger(IL_IMAGE_BPP),ilGetInteger(IL_IMAGE_WIDTH),ilGetInteger(IL_IMAGE_HEIGHT), 0, ilGetInteger(IL_IMAGE_FORMAT), GL_UNSIGNED_BYTE,ilGetData()); /* Texture specification */\n```\n\nThis is inside a loop. It didn't occured a exception until it hit row 257 in the 14th time.\n\nThe difference between the 13th time and the 14th is the width. It changed from 2604 to 999.\n\nThe exception is showed in the picture.\n\n![1](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/5545682/3519066/7645d294-070e-11e4-9fcb-6288c7cd54fc.png)\n\nIt says there is an uncaught exception in 0x02d3fee9: 0xc0005: an corrupt when reading position 0x14b...\n\nSo what is the problem?\n","closed_by":{"login":"kimkulling","id":2323156,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjMxNTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2323156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimkulling","html_url":"https://github.com/kimkulling","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimkulling/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimkulling/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kimkulling/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github